Publications
============

Paste your BibTeX entries below, for example exported from Google Scholar,
DBLP, or Zotero. Each entry starts with an at-sign followed by article,
inproceedings, or a similar type, and contains fields such as title, author,
journal, and year.

Optional fields recognized by this site:

- selected: set to true to feature the paper in the "Selected publications"
  section on the homepage
- abbr: short badge displayed next to the title
- pdf, code, website, slides, poster, video, preview: action buttons on the entry

See the al-folio documentation (docs/CUSTOMIZE.md) for a full example entry.